### Mechanism & Architecture

Custom tools and toolkits are defined using factory functions provided by the core package (`ts/packages/core/src/models/CustomTool.ts`):

1. **Standalone & Extension Tools (`createCustomTool`)**: Created with a unique slug, metadata (name and description), an input parameter schema using Zod (`inputParams`), and an execution callback (`execute`).
2. **Custom Toolkits (`createCustomToolkit`)**: Group multiple custom tools under a single toolkit namespace and identity (`ts/packages/core/src/models/CustomTool.ts`).

